## Design decisions

**No capability interface.** An earlier draft defined a `SessionLister` optional interface with per-agent `ListRepoSessions` implementations. Dropped because 5 of 7 agents would have had identical one-liner methods. Replaced with a single `listSessionsForAgent` dispatcher with a 2-case type switch for Codex/Copilot. Mild deviation from the `agent/capabilities.go` pattern, accepted because only 2 agents deviate.

**No prompt extraction for untracked rows.** Tracked sessions use `LastPrompt` from their state file; untracked rows show `agent + short-id + mtime + [untracked]` only. The picker is for discovery; once picked, the full transcript feeds `runAttach` as today.

